  "decision_conditions": [
    "The rear dormer due to its  wide and bulky form viewed in conjunction with the side gabled roof extension would constitute an incongruous, unsympathetic and over dominant form of development which would not be subservient to the main building and would not be in keeping with the prevailing pattern of development in the area and would not preserve or enhance the character and appearance of the conservation area. In this respect the proposal if permitted would harm the character and appearance area contrary to Policies 28 and 30 of the Sutton Local Plan 2018 and the advice in Supplementary Planning Document 4: The Design of Residential Extensions and Supplementary Planning Document 14 'Creating Locally Distinctive Places'.\r"
  ],
